Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you hear your\Nfamily calling your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:04.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,name from the dark\Npine woods
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:06.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,tonight, do not open\Nthe door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:09.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,A skinwalker only\Nneeds to hear your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:12.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,voice once to steal it\Nforever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:15.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,It stands nine feet\Ntall at the edge of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:18.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,the clearing, hiding\Nits skeletal frame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:21.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,behind the trees,\Nperfectly mimicking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:24.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,the voice of someone\Nyou love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let us go back to the\Nbeginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:29.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,At two in the morning,\Nmy sister Mira's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:32.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,voice floated through\Nmy cabin window,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:35.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,begging me to unlock\Nthe porch door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:37.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,But Mira lived two\Nhours away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:40.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the city, her car\Nwas not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,outside, and she had\Nnot visited
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,this cabin in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,A human throat has one\Nvocal cord,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:52.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,but this creature\Npossesses two separate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:55.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,acoustic voice boxes,\Nsplitting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:58.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,like the syrinx of a\Nlyrebird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,By vibrating both\Nchambers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:02.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,simultaneously, it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,can copy a chainsaw, a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:06.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,crying infant, or your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:09.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,sister's exact voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:11.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yet copying is not\Nspeaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,It does not understand\Nhuman words,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:17.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,so it merely replays\Nrecorded
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:19.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,sound waves like a\Nparrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:23.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,That is why it repeats\Nthe identical sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:27.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,twice: Noah, please\Nunlock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Noah, please unlock\Nthe door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:32.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up close, you would\Nsee its bleached,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,skeletal frame\Nimmediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:37.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,so it stays back at\Nthe fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:40.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Cold night air bends\Nsound waves
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:42.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,down across the grass,\Ncarrying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,its whisper hundreds\Nof yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,And behind its hollow\Neyes, a reflective
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:51.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,mirror layer shines\Nlike a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:55.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,Its brittle body\Ncannot chase you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Like an anglerfish in\Nthe deep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,ocean, it uses a lure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:03.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the lure is the\Nperson you love most.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:05.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Standing by the door,\NI remembered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,its only weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,It can mimic a sound,\Nbut it cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:13.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,answer an unscripted\Nquestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:16.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Through the wood, I\Nshouted: Mira, what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,did grandpa carve on\Nthe porch bench?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:22.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dead silence swallowed\Nthe forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:26.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then, from the black\Ntrees, the mechanical
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,voice replayed once\Nmore:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:31.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Noah, please unlock\Nthe door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:34.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,I threw the deadbolt,\Njust as a nine-foot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:37.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,shadow stepped onto\Nthe porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:41.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inspired by folklore\Nof the vocal mimic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:42.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Would you have opened\Nthe door?
